STATEMENT: >>>
The decisions still open that shape what the view will show. Each row is one; its word is the node's own STATUS on the day of the render.

- What DEPTH means on a WORK node: design maturity, delivery, or nothing once execution state lives in beads. Until it closes, a WORK node's DEPTH reads as the migration left it.
[LINK: DEC-WORK-STATE-FIELD] [OPEN]
- Whether code samples, diagrams and other maintained projections become types of their own or stay narratives with a widget. Nothing needs them yet.
[LINK: DEC-INLINE-CODE-TYPE] [OPEN]
- Whether the six non-narrative types gain TAGS so a node can name a system by hand -- a tooling mechanism that is really part of the future beads engine. Open until the beads import makes the need concrete.
[LINK: DEC-SYSTEM-TAG-ON-EVERY-ELEMENT] [OPEN]
<<<
PARENT_FP: >>>
